    },
    {
      "front": {
        "flashcardContentBlock": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "\ub450 \ud568\uc218 $f$\uc640 $g$\uac00 \uc11c\ub85c \uac19\uc74c\uc744 \uae30\ud638\ub85c \uc5b4\ub5bb\uac8c \ub098\ud0c0\ub0b4\ub294\uac00?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "back": {
        "flashcardContentBlock": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "$f = g$"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "front": {
        "flashcardContentBlock": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "\uc815\uc758\uc5ed\uc774 $\\{-1, 1\\}$\uc778 \ub450 \ud568\uc218 $f(x) = x$\uc640 $g(x) = x^3$\uc740 \uc11c\ub85c \uac19\uc740 \ud568\uc218\uc778\uac00?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "back": {
        "flashcardContentBlock": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "\uc11c\ub85c \uac19\uc740 \ud568\uc218\uc774\ub2e4 ($f = g$). ($f(-1) = g(-1) = -1$ \uc774\uace0 $f(1) = g(1) = 1$\ub85c \ubaa8\ub4e0 \uc6d0\uc18c\uc758 \ud568\uc22b\uac12\uc774 \uac19\uc74c)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "front": {
        "flashcardContentBlock": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "\ud568\uc218 $f : X \\to Y$\uc5d0\uc11c \uc815\uc758\uc5ed $X$\uc758 \uac01 \uc6d0\uc18c $x$\uc640 \uc774\uc5d0 \ub300\uc751\ud558\ub294 \ud568\uc22b\uac12 $f(x)$\uc758 \uc21c\uc11c\uc30d \uc804\uccb4\uc758 \uc9d1\ud569\uc744 \ubb34\uc5c7\uc774\ub77c\uace0 \ud558\ub294\uac00?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "back": {
        "flashcardContentBlock": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "\ud568\uc218 $y = f(x)$\uc758 \uadf8\ub798\ud504 (Graph)"
